  "details": "Taking 8k videos would be a lot easier if we had an 8k spout camera.\n\nCurrently, when we take an 8k video, we need at least a 4k monitor(or dummy adapter) to set the desktop resolution to 8k with the DSR feature and then maximize the desktop window of VRChat and then record it with the OBS.\n\nIf we had an 8k spout camera, we just set the canvas size of OBS to 8k and resize the spout capture and boom it's complete.",
